<title>UK: Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Valora.</title>
<headline>Bank Vontobel sets warrants on Valora.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank J Vontobel &amp; Co AG says it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Valora Holding AG.</p>
<p>20 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    330.00 CHF		PREMIUM	19.27 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.00 CHF		  GEARING	7.8 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.MAR.97-21.MAY.98   PAYDATE	04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 1500</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
